FSOT-2.1-Cpp
Copyright 2026 Damian Arthur Palumbo

This product is a C++20 port of the FSOT 2.1 computational engine,
whose authority is vendor/fsot_compute.py in
https://github.com/dappalumbo91/FSOT-2.1-Lean (pin AEB2AD), also by
Damian Arthur Palumbo and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The trinary core reproduces the behaviour of the trit implementations in
the public repositories FSOT-Genetics, fsot-neuron-zig, FSOT-GPU,
FSOT-Quantum and FSOT-Reality-OS by the same author.

Optional build dependencies (not bundled): Boost.Multiprecision / Boost.Math
headers (Boost Software License 1.0) and GCC libquadmath (LGPL, runtime library).
